ifth ruler, King Isipum (King Myeong). He ascended the throne in the 1st year of Yongping under Emperor Hui of Jin. He died on the 8th day of the 7th month in the 2nd year of Yonghe (Bingwu) under Emperor Mu of Jin. His posthumous title was King Deok.","jp":"金官伽耶（駕洛国）の第4代王。父は麻品王、母は好仇。王妃は阿志（阿躬阿干の孫娘）、子は第5代王の伊尸品王（明王）。晋の恵帝の永平元年に即位。晋の穆帝の永和2年丙午7月8日に崩御。諡号は徳王。","kr":"금관가야(가락국)의 제4대 왕. 아버지는 마품왕, 어머니는 호구이다. 왕비는 아지(아궁 아간의 손녀)이며, 아들은 제5대 왕인 이시품왕(명왕)이다. 진 혜제 영평 원년에 즉위하였으며, 진 목제 영화 2년 병오년 7월 8일에 붕어하였다. 시호는 덕왕이다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1049915","remark":"普武","surname":"金","surnameTc":"金","surnameEn":"Kim","surnameJp":"金","surnameKr":"금","surnameOther":"","name":"居叱弥","nameTc":"居叱彌","nameEn":"Geojilmi","nameJp":"居叱弥","nameKr":"거질미","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"金居叱弥","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"190","city":"CS1068","gender":"0","rule":"52","force":"54","wise":"54","politics":"54","charm":"54","will":"56","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"30/32/32/54/23/26/30/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"1200","battleSoulPoint":"2700","debateSoulPoint":"3200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1008501","professions":"4/3/3/2/0/0/2/0/1/1/0/0/2/2/1/0/2/1/1/1/0/5/2/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"95","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"8300","title":"1","rank":"1","birth":"259","show":"272","death":"346","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapo